{"3652300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heir of Twilight", "steam_appid": 3652300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unknown artifact. A forbidden fusion. A race against fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a mysterious <i>Crystal</i> appears in Breezewood, Baron Faustus sees it as a chance to rise in power. But when conflict erupts, the Crystal reacts in an unexpected way: Hanzo and a half-wolf, Rex, are fused into a single being—<strong>Hanzorex</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, catastrophe follows: mutant creatures, unexplained disasters, creeping terrors… On the run, Faustus seeks to unravel the secrets of the Crystal, unaware that he’s toying with forces far beyond his grasp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside Alberic, Hanzorex must face the dangers ahead, hunt down Faustus, and uncover a mystery that could upend the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins. Will you dare to uncover the truth?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating world of <i>Heir of the Half-Light</i>, a turn-based tactical RPG inspired by the legendary combat system of <strong>Octopath Traveler™</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to 9 heroes with unique abilities and forge a team capable of defying fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elemental forces of nature to shatter enemy defenses and unleash devastating combos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a myriad of enemies, from the darkest beasts to forgotten entities of ancient worlds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let yourself be carried away by a mesmerizing soundtrack, rich in diverse inspirations, accompanying every moment of triumph… or tragedy.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unknown artifact. A forbidden fusion. A race against fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a mysterious <i>Crystal</i> appears in Breezewood, Baron Faustus sees it as a chance to rise in power. But when conflict erupts, the Crystal reacts in an unexpected way: Hanzo and a half-wolf, Rex, are fused into a single being—<strong>Hanzorex</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, catastrophe follows: mutant creatures, unexplained disasters, creeping terrors… On the run, Faustus seeks to unravel the secrets of the Crystal, unaware that he’s toying with forces far beyond his grasp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside Alberic, Hanzorex must face the dangers ahead, hunt down Faustus, and uncover a mystery that could upend the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins. Will you dare to uncover the truth?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating world of <i>Heir of the Half-Light</i>, a turn-based tactical RPG inspired by the legendary combat system of <strong>Octopath Traveler™</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to 9 heroes with unique abilities and forge a team capable of defying fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elemental forces of nature to shatter enemy defenses and unleash devastating combos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a myriad of enemies, from the darkest beasts to forgotten entities of ancient worlds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let yourself be carried away by a mesmerizing soundtrack, rich in diverse inspirations, accompanying every moment of triumph… or tragedy.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An unknown artifact is spreading chaos across the world of Farnia. Join Alberic and Hanz